&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Building the world’s leading&amp;nbsp;full-stack fulfillment platform&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;challenging&amp;nbsp;work. The problems we solve are complex, the pace is fast, and the bar is high.&amp;nbsp;That means&amp;nbsp;ShipBob’s&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;isn’t&amp;nbsp;the right&amp;nbsp;fit for everyone, and&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;okay.&amp;nbsp;If you are ready to take ownership,&amp;nbsp;push boundaries, and&amp;nbsp;grow alongside a team that genuinely supports each other, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about our core values and how we perform at a high level in our day-to-day work on our Culture page (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;About Us: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob is a leading global supply chain and fulfillment technology platform designed for SMB and Mid-Market ecommerce merchants to provide them access to best-in-class capabilities and to deliver a delightful shopper experience. Merchants can outsource their entire fulfillment operations, utilize &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; proprietary warehouse management system for in-house fulfillment, or take advantage of a hybrid solution across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; dozens of fulfillment center network in the United States, Canada, United Kingdom, Europe, and Australia. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; is backed by leading investors like Menlo Ventures, Bain Capital Ventures, Hyde Park Venture Partners, and SoftBank Vision Fund 2, and is one of the fastest-growing tech companies headquartered in Chicago.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At ShipBob, every full-time employee gets access to our best-in-class AI and productivity tools from Day 1 at no cost. This isn&#39;t a pilot or a perk for select teams. It&#39;s standard for everyone. We believe innovation isn&#39;t owned by one department. Whether you&#39;re in Talent, Operations, Finance, Engineering, or Customer Success, we expect you to ask: &lt;em&gt;how can this be done better, faster, or smarter?&lt;/em&gt; These tools are our investment in your ability to find those answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI-Assisted Tools During Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use AI-assisted tools during the recruitment process to support administrative functions such as transcribing interviews, generating summaries or notes, organizing interview feedback, facilitating candidate communications, and helping recruiters identify candidates whose qualifications may align with job requirements. These tools are designed to assist our recruiting team and are not used to make final hiring decisions.&amp;nbsp;Hiring decisions are made by trained human reviewers who consider the candidate&#39;s application, interview performance, qualifications, experience, and other relevant factors. AI-assisted tools do not independently determine whether a candidate advances in the hiring process or receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;Where required by applicable law, candidates will be provided with notice regarding our use of AI-assisted technologies and, where available, information about any applicable rights relating to such processing, including the ability to request additional information or opt out of certain AI-assisted processing activities. Candidates who exercise available opt-out rights may be reviewed through alternative processes consistent with applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;ompensation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;and training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is no deadline to apply for this position, as ShipBob accepts applications on an ongoing basis&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Forward Networks is transforming how the world’s most complex networks are managed and secured. Founded in 2013 by four Stanford Ph.D.s, we built the industry’s first network digital twin — a mathematically precise model of the production network that gives IT teams unmatched visibility, verification, and agility across every major cloud and vendor environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers include global leaders such as Goldman Sachs, PayPal, S&amp;amp;P Global, IBM, and Dell, as well as fast-growing enterprises and government agencies. According to IDC, Forward Networks customers realize an average of $14.2 million in annual benefits through improved efficiency and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by world-class investors including Andreessen Horowitz, Goldman Sachs, MSD Partners, and Threshold Ventures, Forward Networks offers a people-centric, innovative culture where brilliant minds are shaping the future of network reliability, security, and AI-ready operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forward Networks is looking for an experienced Regional Sales Director UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to create a category and help build a special company?&lt;br&gt;Do you want to sell a platform that solves real networking problems?&lt;br&gt;Do sensible quotas and no cap on earnings pique your interest?&lt;br&gt;Join a company that has been in the market 6+ years and has some of the top F500/Global 2000 and Federal agencies already buying and referenceable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have 7-10 years of wildly successful experience selling to large enterprises and have also been on the journey of building a growth stage company...you may be the one!&lt;br&gt;We are building a special team and hope you consider us if you want to be part of changing the networking world as we know it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the development and execution of your sales strategy in territory that aligns with the company&#39;s goals and objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and qualify leads, and generate new Fortune 1000 opportunities in order to achieve quota on a quarterly and annual basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strategic working relationships with clients, maintaining a high level of face-to-face contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze potential sales opportunities by using data analysis and segmented research to identify the attributes most valued by our potential clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the competitive landscape and maintain a client database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 7-10 years in Enterprise Sales focused on large enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting and exceeding quota in technology sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the networking and security industry, products,&lt;br&gt;competitors, history, emerging trends, and changing marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in selling Enterprise software with an ARR model preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to communicate business and technical value to all levels of&lt;br&gt;management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and listening skills; persuasive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in IT infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior People Partner - 12m FTC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;London (Vauxhall)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hybrid 2-3days per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;£79,000-85,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore is looking for an experienced People Partner to join our People team on a maternity cover basis. This is a hands-on role in a fast paced environment, with responsibility across employee relations, performance, organisational change and People development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll inherit live casework and ongoing initiatives from day one, working closely with managers and People colleagues to provide practical, commercially-minded advice and deliver meaningful People initiatives across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who can hit the ground running, is confident operating independently and enjoys balancing day-to-day People partnership with longer-term projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An interest in AI and how it can be applied practically within People would be a bonus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Relations &amp;amp; People Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage end-to-end employee relations work, including absence management, underperformance, behavioural concerns, disciplinary and grievance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and support managers through complex and difficult conversations, ensuring they have the confidence and tools to manage People matters effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide pragmatic, balanced advice that considers both employee experience and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure People processes are applied consistently, fairly and appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the wider People team to deliver and continuously improve our performance management cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise managers on probation, performance improvement plans and performance conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support managers in addressing performance issues early and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure performance processes are applied consistently across our different jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisational Change&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support organisational change initiatives from planning through to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear communications and support managers and employees through periods of change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a sound understanding of relevant employment legislation and People processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure change is managed thoughtfully, consistently and with the right balance of business priority, pace and care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projects, Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own relevant People initiatives end-to-end, taking responsibility for delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and at times lead the rollout and embedding of People platforms, programmes and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver manager capability and development programmes, working with internal and external partners where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use People data, feedback and insight to identify development needs and translate these into practical interventions or improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring curiosity and a practical approach to how AI can improve the People experience and make our processes more effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using or building with AI tools would be a strong advantage, however this is not essential. We’re more interested in someone who is curious, learns quickly and is excited to explore how AI can enable the People function and business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills we&#39;d love you to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant in HR/People, ideally in a generalist or People Partner/HRBP role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-paced, scaling environment, where priorities can change quickly and you’re comfortable operating with a degree of ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of UK employment law and practical experience applying it to employee relations and organisational change. Awareness of employment legislation across South Africa, Australia and/or Canada would be a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex ER casework independently, including absence, performance, conduct, disciplinary and grievance matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning and delivering People projects end-to-end, with examples of the change you’ve driven and the impact it had.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong performance management experience, with the ability to coach managers through challenging performance conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the confidence to challenge and influence managers at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, pragmatic approach and the ability to get up to speed quickly and make an impact from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently while collaborating closely with the wider People team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in AI and how it can be applied practically within People would be a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ClearScore?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore is the UK&#39;s #1 credit score and report app. We are also present in South Africa, Australia and Canada, with more than 20 million users globally and growing fast. Someone joins ClearScore every 20 seconds. We have established relationships with over 50 of the main lenders in the U.K., and have been a trusted tool for customers to manage their credit and make better financial decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since October 2016 we have helped 1.8 million users take out a new credit card or loan. We are user-centric at our core and we believe in leveraging technology to enable positive financial choices. We are design-led and data-driven and we embed these behaviours in everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our company culture is a fundamental part of all we have achieved. We believe in hiring smart, driven, passionate and diverse people who are keen on having a real impact in our organisation. We trust you to manage your own time so we offer flexible work and no fixed desk hours. We don&#39;t micromanage and we believe in measuring outcomes rather than effort. We have an inclusive culture where all, regardless of seniority, are encouraged to contribute with their ideas, look after their wellbeing and actively seek opportunities for career growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you feel like this could be the place for you, apply and our Talent team will be happy to share more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid holidays and a “duvet day” on your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work Environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health and dental cover - including mental health support through Bupa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GP office visits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 6% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular Lunch and Learns with guest speakers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily breakfast and free snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to discounts via Cobens Extras&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free sports and social clubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued investment into learning and development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership-led training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house psychotherapist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coach to help you plan and achieve your goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No clock-watching culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous maternity and paternity plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture and inclusion representatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pay structure and a career growth plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all qualified individuals. As an equal opportunity employer, we are able to make reasonable adjustments to accommodate individuals with disabilities during the recruitment and selection process. If you require accommodation, please inform us in advance, and we will work with you to meet your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Hybrid Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We embrace a&amp;nbsp;dynamic hybrid work environment that balances flexibility with collaborative in-person experiences. Our approach is designed to foster innovation, team connection, and individual productivity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2-3 days per week in-office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We believe this structure offers the best of both worlds - the flexibility of remote work and the synergy of face-to-face collaboration. Our office days are carefully coordinated to maximise team interactions and learning/ mentorship opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What This Means for You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibility to manage your work and life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Dedicated in-office days for team building and collaborative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Office facilities (with plants!) designed for productive interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Clear expectations and support for maintaining our hybrid schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We’re committed to creating an inclusive environment that accommodates diverse needs while maintaining our collaborative culture. Join us in shaping the future of work!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Note: While we offer flexibility, commitment to our hybrid schedule is an important aspect of our team culture and performance expectations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-redactor-tag=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Inclusion Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are always looking for talented individuals to join ClearScore. We are an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for our people. Please see our People Policy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.clearscore.com/people-notice&quot;&gt;https://www.clearscore.com/people-notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist - Full Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note visa sponsorship is not currently available for this position. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Full Stack Data Scientist to join our Data &amp;amp; Analytics team at ClearScore. Data Scientists play a key role in our business, driving strategy and decision-making at all levels, which ultimately benefits our users, partners, and other teams across the organisation. We are seeking a proactive, outcomes-oriented individual, ready to take on broad ownership of a range of initiatives, to join our growing Global Targeting team. Working to enhance the ClearScore user experience through improved dynamic content targeting and prioritisation, you will take end-to-end ownership of data science and machine learning solutions across a variety of use cases, business areas, and markets. You’ll bring the knowledge and expertise required to evaluate transformative new approaches in machine learning and AI against our current implementations, applying your judgement and craft to incorporate these where they can add real value. Your contributions will directly support the Global Targeting mission, enabling the organisation to realise its overall strategy and goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore is both a free credit score and report service and the UK&#39;s leading consumer credit marketplace. ClearScore has an amazing analytical community which includes Data Analysts, Scientists and Engineers. The community works collaboratively, sharing knowledge, tools, and best practice, to ensure a landscape in which team members can develop their full potential and deliver maximum positive business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the end-to-end development of data science and machine learning solutions - from business concept through to impact evaluation - to enable a better user experience through data-driven Targeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with cross-functional stakeholders to shape how Data Science and the broader Targeting initiative can effectively support business needs to drive maximum impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping our modelling practice at the cutting-edge: building a deep understanding of new developments in ML and AI, like Foundation Models, testing these rigorously against our production systems, and leading our adoption of those that prove their value to drive better outcomes for our users and business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to set the quality bar for what we put into production: scrutinising data, features and model behaviour, and surfacing problems in our data and processes before they reach our users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and implementing improvements and optimisations in our model development and management processes, driving more efficient and standardised ways of working, leading by example in what you deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving the strategic utilisation of model outputs for decision making, working with the Global Targeting squad to use model outputs to change what users see&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need to succeed in the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter mindset: curious, collaborative, and committed to continuous learning - including the adoption of new tools as they emerge. You stay abreast of advances in ML and AI, demonstrating the judgement required to assess when newer techniques will outperform conventional ones and when they won’t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to deeply understand a problem and its importance to the business before attempting to solve it, and being comfortable proactively seeking that context rather than waiting for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong ability to think critically about, and reason concisely with, data. A drive to understand our users, products, and how users interact with them, and to build an advanced knowledge of our data assets and how these connect to our users’ financial wellbeing through the product experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Python and SQL skills, and a strong understanding of dbt and Analytics Engineering for feature engineering. In-depth knowledge of varied statistical and machine learning techniques. You&#39;re capable across the full model lifecycle, including how models get deployed and maintained effectively in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience of using business-domain knowledge to drive model development or derive insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to explain the key findings from complex analysis and modelling exercises to both technical and non-technical audiences. You feel at home interacting with stakeholders from across different specialisms around the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d especially love to hear from you if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools as part of your everyday workflow, with the judgement to know what to trust, what to verify, and when the output isn&#39;t good enough. We’re increasingly adopting AI tools as part of our development cycle, so an interest and knowledge of harnessing these effectively would be highly valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience developing and delivering solutions based on emerging ML/AI approaches in Deep Learning, such as representation learning, sequence models, transformer-based modelling, or foundation models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing or working on real-time / near real-time inference solutions and the infrastructure to support them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and deploying solutions into Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a product-focussed environment, partnering closely with cross-functional teams to build and iterate quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of consumer lending and the key drivers of credit and affordability strategies, as well as familiarity with credit bureau data and its effective utilisation for building predictive ML models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A postgraduate degree or equivalent qualification in a STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ClearScore?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClearScore is the UK&#39;s #1 credit score and report app. We are also present in South Africa, Australia and Canada, with more than 20 million users globally and growing fast. Someone joins ClearScore every 20 seconds. We have established relationships with over 50 of the main lenders in the U.K., and have been a trusted tool for customers to manage their credit and make better financial decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since October 2016 we have helped 1.8 million users take out a new credit card or loan. We are user-centric at our core and we believe in leveraging technology to enable positive financial choices. We are design-led and data-driven and we embed these behaviours in everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our company culture is a fundamental part of all we have achieved. We believe in hiring smart, driven, passionate and diverse people who are keen on having a real impact in our organisation. We trust you to manage your own time so we offer flexible work and no fixed desk hours. We don&#39;t micromanage and we believe in measuring outcomes rather than effort. We have an inclusive culture where all, regardless of seniority, are encouraged to contribute with their ideas, look after their wellbeing and actively seek opportunities for career growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you feel like this could be the place for you, apply and our Talent team will be happy to share more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid holidays and a “duvet day” on your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Work Environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health and dental cover - including mental health support through Bupa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GP office visits&lt;/li&gt;
