&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships by understanding the unique needs of each business and showing how SumUp can make a real difference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go on-site to meet prospects and clients in person — building trust face-to-face and delivering demos that convert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver value-driven product pitches and demos that help convert curiosity into commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle — from first outreach to deal closed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track your performance, meet your goals, and continuously level up through feedback and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights, collaborate with your team, and help build an energised outbound culture in the office&lt;/li&gt;
